{"id": "48", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, also on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n\nThese steps will result in a neatly folded quilt with four even corners. Note that the size of the quilt is not specified in the passages, so these steps can be applied to quilts of any size.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI need to analyze the physical details of folding a quilt step by step based on the given passages. However, I notice that no actual passage content was provided in your query - only the question \"how to fold a quilt\" and the instruction structure. Without specific textual information about quilt folding procedures, I cannot generate a logical reasoning step that analyzes physical details from the given material. The passages required to complete this task appear to be missing.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 53.716, "generation_time_seconds": 53.5982, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1171, "nemotron": {"method": "pd", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "cluster_num": 2, "sigma_rate": 1.0, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "51", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick has several benefits, according to the given passages. It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, a water pick can clean better around the teeth and gums, reaching areas that brushing may not be able to access.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 27.104, "generation_time_seconds": 27.0772, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0263, "nemotron": {"method": "pd", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "cluster_num": 2, "sigma_rate": 1.0, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
