{"id": "138", "question": "what is the treatment when asset is discarded as per income tax act", "gt": "Based on the Income Tax Act, when an asset is discarded but not sold, the scrap value of the asset can be reduced from the block in the previous year in which the asset is discarded as per section 43(6). This is done under the block concept, where all assets of the same class and subject to the same rate of depreciation are considered as a single asset. Any changes to the block's value must abide by the provisions of Chapter IV D of the Income Tax Act, 1961. Additionally, the assessee can claim depreciation on the residual value of such discarded asset, even if it's not used for the purposes of business or profession in that year and subsequent years.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI need to analyze the given passages to find information about the treatment of assets when they are discarded under the Income Tax Act. However, I don't see any passages provided in your query. Without the actual text passages containing information about the Income Tax Act and asset disposal treatments, I cannot proceed with the analysis or provide a meaningful next reasoning step.\nI need the actual passages containing information about the Income Tax Act and asset disposal treatments to analyze. Without the provided text passages, I cannot identify any details about how assets are treated when discarded under the Income Tax Act. Please provide the relevant passages for analysis.\nI need the actual passages containing information about the Income Tax Act and asset disposal treatments to analyze. Without the provided text passages, I cannot identify any details about how assets are treated when discarded under the Income Tax Act. Please provide the relevant passages for analysis.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 91.129, "generation_time_seconds": 90.9971, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1315, "nemotron": {"method": "pd", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "cluster_num": 2, "sigma_rate": 1.0, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 2.56, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "139", "question": "what is the treatment when asset is discarded as per income tax act", "gt": "Based on the given passages, when an asset is discarded but not sold, the scrap value of the asset can be reduced from the block in the previous year in which the asset is discarded. The block concept is followed, where assets of the same class and subject to the same rate of depreciation are grouped together and considered as a single asset. The assessee is entitled to claim depreciation on the residual value of the discarded asset, even if it is not used for business or profession in that year and subsequent years.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI need to analyze the given passages to find information about the treatment of an asset when it is discarded under the Income Tax Act. However, I don't see any passages provided in your query. Without the actual text passages containing information about tax treatment for discarded assets, I cannot proceed with the analysis or provide a meaningful reasoning step.\nI need to analyze the given passages to find information about the treatment of an asset when it is discarded under the Income Tax Act. However, I don't see any passages provided in your query. Without the actual text passages containing information about tax treatment for discarded assets, I cannot proceed with the analysis or provide a meaningful reasoning step.\nI need to analyze the given passages to find information about the treatment of an asset when it is discarded under the Income Tax Act. However, I don't see any passages provided in your query. Without the actual text passages containing information about tax treatment for discarded assets, I cannot proceed with the analysis or provide a meaningful reasoning step.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 91.031, "generation_time_seconds": 90.806, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2245, "nemotron": {"method": "pd", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "cluster_num": 2, "sigma_rate": 1.0, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "142", "question": "what is the treatment when asset is discarded as per income tax act", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the treatment for an asset that is discarded as per the Income Tax Act is as follows:\n\nThe scrap value of the asset can be reduced from the block in the previous year in which the asset is discarded, as per Section 43(6) of the Income Tax Act. The block concept applies to all assets falling within the same class and subject to the same rate of depreciation, and any alterations to the value of the block must be made in accordance with the provisions of Chapter IV D of the Income Tax Act. The assessee can claim depreciation on the residual value of the discarded asset (i.e., opening WDV of such asset less scrap value) even if the asset is not used for business or professional purposes in that year or subsequent years.\n\nTherefore, the treatment for an asset that is discarded as per the Income Tax Act is to reduce the scrap value from the block in the previous year and claim depreciation on the residual value.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI need to analyze the given passages to find information about the treatment of an asset when it is discarded under the Income Tax Act. However, I don't see any passages provided in your query. Without the actual text passages containing relevant information about asset disposal treatment under the Income Tax Act, I cannot perform the required analysis or determine what the next logical reasoning step should be.\nI need to analyze the given passages to find information about the treatment of an asset when it is discarded under the Income Tax Act. However, I don't see any passages provided in your query. Without the actual text passages containing relevant information about asset disposal treatment under the Income Tax Act, I cannot perform the required analysis or determine what the next logical reasoning step should be.\nI need to analyze the given passages to find information about the treatment of an asset when it is discarded under the Income Tax Act. However, I don't see any passages provided in your query. Without the actual text passages containing relevant information about asset disposal treatment under the Income Tax Act, I cannot perform the required analysis or determine what the next logical reasoning step should be.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 104.525, "generation_time_seconds": 104.4843, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0402, "nemotron": {"method": "pd", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "cluster_num": 2, "sigma_rate": 1.0, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.66, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
